1、本科及以上学历，专业不限；
2、有客户对接或销售支持实习经验，具备数据理解与处理能力；
3、具备广告诚信或信任与安全领域的实习经验；
4、具备任务优先级规划与管理能力；
5、具备英语及商务日语能力（书面与口语达标）。

1.Bachelor’s degree or above with no restrictions on majors;
2.Prior internship experience in client communication or sales support with basic data comprehension and processing capabilities;
3.Previous internship exposure in ad integrity, trust & safety or related fields is preferred;
4.Solid capability to prioritize and manage multiple ongoing tasks;
5.Proficient in written and spoken English and business Japanese.

